Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 20:06:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Double sound volumes, reorder About before Contact, fix decor
 overlap, add decor to Home

- All 5 sounds (hover/click/intro/scramble) doubled in volume
- PANEL_IDS reordered: about now comes before contact
- MechanicalDecor: dropped from 4 gears to 2 (opposite corners only,
  pushed further off-canvas), equations moved to the untouched vertical
  center band and enlarged (text-xl/2xl, higher opacity) so they're
  actually legible and never overlap the gears
- HomePanel: replaced the particle field with MechanicalDecor, matching
  the About page's gears + CFD equations aesthetic
- EntryGate's particle effect left untouched (different screen, only
  the home page itself was in scope)
